                                                "sense_id": "e8a3de5c-9330-34ee-8a50-01146400e66c",
                                                "text": "In which the birds song many a lovely lay / Of Gods high praise, and of their loves sweet teene, / As it an earthly Paradize had beene […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a9dd0991-3a7a-475c-8848-ef7697fd5ba6",
                                                "sense_id": "e8a3de5c-9330-34ee-8a50-01146400e66c",
                                                "text": "The Soldan changed hue for grief and teen, / On that sad book his shame and loss he lear'd."
